#N canvas 40 60 1320 760 8-fm-voices 0;
#X text 20 10 EIGHT FM VOICES (Chowning 1973) \, one on each harmonic of f0: voice k has carrier k * f0 and modulator ratio * k * f0. Phase modulation: y_k = cos(2 pi phase_k + I_k * cos(2 pi mod_k)) \, with index I_k = Imax * (out_k + 1) / 2 from the network. Its spectrum: lines at k f0 +- n ratio k f0 with amplitudes J_n(I_k) (Bessel functions). Every voice goes back to the network through [s~ \$0-v<k>]. Spectral tilt: voice k at 1/k., f 180;
