#X text 20 10 GESTURES: the 4 FM controls (index \, ratio \, feedback \, VAE noise tau) are recorded for 32 frames of 125 ms = 4 seconds into cur\$0 (lane p starts at p * 32). Every number is stored between -1 and 1 (u = 2 x - 1 \, x = the slider position 0 .. 1). PLAYING loops the gesture: every 25 ms the playhead moves 1/5 of a frame and each lane is interpolated linearly between two frames - the sliders move by themselves. gmode_\$0: 0 = by hand \, 1 = recording \, 2 = playing., f 208;
#X obj 20 90 r \$0-imax;
#X obj 20 116 v imax_\$0;
#X obj 160 90 r \$0-ratio;
