#X obj 20 39 r \$0-dgrad;
#X obj 20 69 t b b b;
#X text 80 69 1) dL/dB2_j = g a_j. The delta of neuron j: d_j = g B2_j lrelu'(q_j) \, lrelu' = 1 or 0.2 \, and dL/db1_j = d_j, f 64;
