#N canvas 40 60 1240 900 generator 0;
#X text 20 10 THE GENERATOR G turns a latent point z = (z1 \, z2) into mixing weights for your gestures and mixes them: h = tanh(A1 z + a1) (16 neurons) \, logit_n = A2[n] . h + a2_n (one per gesture) \, w = softmax(logit / T) \, G(z) = sum_n w_n g_n. Parameters in gp\$0: A1 (16 x 2) at 0 \, a1 at 32 \, A2 (16 x 16 \, row n = gesture n) at 48 and a2 at 304 - the caller sets z0_\$0 \, z1_\$0 and temp_\$0 (T = 1 while training)., f 168;
#X obj 20 69 r \$0-genw;
#X obj 20 99 t b b b;
#X text 80 99 1) hidden layer: h_j = tanh(A1[j \, 1] z1 + A1[j \, 2] z2 + a1_j), f 64;
#X msg 80 139 16;
#X msg 120 139 0;
#X obj 80 165 until;
#X obj 80 191 f;
#X obj 120 191 + 1;
#X obj 80 219 expr gh\$0[\$f1] = tanh(gp\$0[2 * \$f1] * z0_\$0 + gp\$0[2 * \$f1 + 1] * z1_\$0 + gp\$0[32 + \$f1]), f 64;
#X obj 20 271 t b b b;
#X text 80 271 2) one logit per gesture \, starting with its bias a2_n, f 64;
#X obj 80 294 v nfav_\$0;
#X msg 165 294 0;
#X obj 80 320 until;
#X obj 80 346 f;
#X obj 120 346 + 1;
#X obj 80 374 expr gl\$0[\$f1] = gp\$0[304 + \$f1], f 64;
#X obj 20 410 t b b b;
#X text 80 410 3) logit_n += A2[n \, j] * h_j, f 64;
#X obj 80 433 expr nfav_\$0 * 16;
#X msg 221 433 0;
#X obj 80 459 until;
#X obj 80 485 f;
