#X text 20 10 THE MAP OF THE LATENT SPACE: for each of the 10 x 10 cells \, ask the generator for its mixing weights at the cell centre and colour the cell by the gesture with the biggest weight - pale = a blend. Then count how many gestures own at least one cell (80% or more): the gestures the GAN can play. Missing ones = mode collapse., f 168;
