#X text 20 10 THE SOUND the 4 clouds read: the array smp\$0 \, any length. ls_\$0 = its length in samples \, fsr_\$0 = its sample rate \, sr_\$0 = Pd's \, so grains play at the right pitch whatever the file. Left: the default sound and the picture. Right: your own file \, sampling the FM synth \, and a test sound., f 220;
