#X text 20 10 THE GRANULAR SYNTH: 4 clouds read the same sound smp\$0 (open them). Their outputs are summed into [s~ \$0-gran] \, the mix level is in the LISTEN panel., f 120;
#N canvas 40 60 800 1640 cloud-1 0;
#X text 20 10 CLOUD 1 - its 6 numbers are gnat\$0[0] .. [5]: position \, spray \, grain size (ms) \, density (grains per second) \, pitch (semitones) \, level. THE CLOCK: every 2 ms the phase gph\$0[0] grows by density x 0.002 \, and each time it passes 1 a grain fires (so a new density acts at once). Each grain gets a start = (position +- spray) of the sound \, a duration = the size but at most 8000 / density ms (so 8 voices are always enough) and a reading speed 2^(pitch / 12) x file rate / Pd rate. The 8 voices take turns. Every voice reads with [tabread4~] under a Hann window., f 105;
#X obj 20 130 loadbang;
#X obj 20 156 metro 2;
#X obj 20 182 expr gph\$0[0] = gph\$0[0] + gnat\$0[3] * 0.002;
#X obj 20 208 moses 1;
#X text 440 182 <- the clock: density x 2 ms per tick, f 26;
#X obj 80 234 t b b;
#X obj 200 260 expr gph\$0[0] = gph\$0[0] - 1;
#X text 440 260 <- passed 1: keep the rest \, and fire a grain, f 26;
#X obj 80 300 t b b b;
#X obj 440 326 expr gnat\$0[5] * 0.5 / sqrt(max(1 \, gnat\$0[3] * min(gnat\$0[2] \, 8000 / max(gnat\$0[3] \, 0.5)) / 1000)), f 34;
#X obj 440 386 s \$0-cg0;
#X text 440 416 ^ loudness: level / sqrt(how many grains overlap) \, so dense clouds do not get louder, f 40;
#X obj 200 330 s \$0-nv0;
#X text 200 356 ^ the next voice (below), f 20;
#X obj 80 500 t b b;
#X obj 140 526 expr gr\$0[0] = fmod(gnat\$0[0] + gnat\$0[1] * (float(random(0 \, 2001)) / 1000 - 1) + 2 \, 1), f 54;
#X text 540 526 <- 1) where: position +- spray \, wrapped into 0 .. 1, f 30;
#X obj 80 578 expr min(max(gr\$0[0] * ls_\$0 \, 1) \, max(ls_\$0 - pow(2 \, gnat\$0[4] / 12) * fsr_\$0 * min(gnat\$0[2] \, 8000 / max(gnat\$0[3] \, 0.5)) / 1000 - 2 \, 1)) \; min(max(gr\$0[0] * ls_\$0 \, 1) \, max(ls_\$0 - pow(2 \, gnat\$0[4] / 12) * fsr_\$0 * min(gnat\$0[2] \, 8000 / max(gnat\$0[3] \, 0.5)) / 1000 - 2 \, 1)) + pow(2 \, gnat\$0[4] / 12) * fsr_\$0 * min(gnat\$0[2] \, 8000 / max(gnat\$0[3] \, 0.5)) / 1000 \; min(gnat\$0[2] \, 8000 / max(gnat\$0[3] \, 0.5)), f 60;
